    m "Ah, uh-" 

    s "What's your name ?" 

    m "Abdul-Maj-" 

    s "Alright Abby, I'm Stheno. Nice to meet you." 

    "Am I even allowed to talk ?" 

    s "So, what you come to do at such a shitty college." 

