    "Damn, her face is hard to read. Go girl, give the new guy nothing!" 

    m "I got accepted into a few good schools, but this one was actually willing to offer me a scholarship as well as a dorm room." 

    s "You poor?" 

    m "Where I'm from not really, but once you go out of the country-" 

    s "Yeah, yeah, I get it. Cost of living and shit." 

    m "I'm really lucky to be here, can't believe I'll start living alone tomorrow." 

    s "Yup so that you can start flipping burgers in a year or two." 

    m "!" 

    s "Believe me, grants don't last long. And it's not with a shitty diploma like the one they'll give us that you'll find a job anytime soon." 

    m "..." 

    s "Your sappy attitude warms my heart but you need to get real bro." 

    m "Do I? I'm not really here for the diploma... In fact I'm already ahead of the program, I reviewed it in Harvard's online curriculum." 

    s "Harvard, huh? We all got started on that over the summer. You're already like 2 months late, you aren't all that special." 

    m "I did the whole course." 

    s "HUH?!" 

    m "Yeah, I really wanted to get into some schools so... I guess I got a little carried away." 

    s "Carried away ? You're fucking crazy!" 

    m "Well, just goes to show how much I wanted to come here. It's been my dream." 

    s "Well," 
    s "Welcome to Rose Springs, Wyoming" 
    s "Where dreams come to die !" 

