# --- PARTIE 7 : PRÉPARATION DU COCKTAIL AVEC CASSIE DANS LA CUISINE ---

label prologue_part7_kitchen_cocktail:

    "I don't know her yet, but I'm all too familiar with that feeling. Helping others... but not being able to help yourself." 

    c "Nearsighted, right?" 

    "!" 

    m "That must be your first impression of me, right?" 
    m "Sorry, you caught me off guard. I was genuinely wondering about that." 

    c "How so?" 

    m "Stheno seems cool but she can't just talk to you like that!" 
    m "You just came out of a panic attack and she just lunges at you with her attitude." 
